sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: CustomerInformationRequest (report = true, clear = true, idToken)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: report true<br>clear true<br>idToken.idToken = Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken<br>idToken.type = Configured valid_idtoken_type
    CS-->>CSMS: CustomerInformationResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyCustomerInformationRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyCustomerInformationResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
